  "scope": "Two logical parties in one native process with independent OS-seeded randomness, genuine base OT, explicit ExConv7x24 before base setup, regular noise, and local coroutine sockets. Counts include base setup and expansion. Every triple and an independent shared AND are checked after timing. Process peak RSS covers both roles and excludes Worker overhead. No ML-DSA signing or Wasm performance claim.",
  "assumptions": "Selected silent OT adds the published LPN assumption; Silver is excluded."
